{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0117-s001", "text": "Om du har en låg inkomst och du är stadigvarande bosatt i Finland kan du ha rätt till F P A:s bostadsbidrag.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0117-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.170340136054422, "peak": 0.270751953125, "generation_seconds": 39.96300091291778, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0117-s002", "text": "Du kan söka bidrag för hyran och till exempel vattenavgifterna och uppvärmningskostnaderna.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0117-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.9412244897959186, "peak": 0.546722412109375, "generation_seconds": 30.37295628292486, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0118-s001", "text": "Med stadigvarande boende avses att du har ditt egentliga hem i Finland och huvudsakligen också vistas i landet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0118-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.543401360544218, "peak": 0.26287841796875, "generation_seconds": 34.224075275007635, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0118-s002", "text": "För att kunna få bostadsbidrag måste du även ha rätt till F P A:s förmåner.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0118-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.174965986394557, "peak": 0.25457763671875, "generation_seconds": 24.584197805961594, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0119-s001", "text": "F P A:s stöd för boende är följande:", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0119-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.1099319727891155, "peak": 0.291046142578125, "generation_seconds": 14.204445274779573, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0120-s001", "text": "allmänt bostadsbidrag", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0120-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 2.647074829931973, "peak": 0.526519775390625, "generation_seconds": 10.286772646009922, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0122-s001", "text": "bostadsbidrag för pensionstagare", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0122-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.4133333333333336, "peak": 0.294403076171875, "generation_seconds": 12.174148203106597, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0123-s001", "text": "bostadsunderstöd i samband med militärunderstöd för värnpliktiga och civiltjänstgörare.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0123-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.080544217687075, "peak": 0.338592529296875, "generation_seconds": 22.04782193689607, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0124-s001", "text": "Vanligtvis kan du få endast ett stöd för boende i taget.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0124-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.085170068027211, "peak": 0.310882568359375, "generation_seconds": 16.250693841837347, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0125-s001", "text": "Stöd kan betalas till en person eller till ett hushåll (ruokakunta).", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0125-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.060408163265306, "peak": 0.282928466796875, "generation_seconds": 19.195872916840017, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0125-s002", "text": "Till samma hushåll hör vanligtvis alla som stadigvarande bor i samma bostad.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0125-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.896326530612245, "peak": 0.42572021484375, "generation_seconds": 23.389954549027607, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0125-s003", "text": "Vanligen består ett hushåll av ett äkta par, sambor eller en familj.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0125-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.2693877551020405, "peak": 0.256072998046875, "generation_seconds": 23.785296936985105, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0125-s004", "text": "Också en person kan vara ett hushåll.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0125-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.5526530612244898, "peak": 0.266998291015625, "generation_seconds": 13.393254755064845, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0125-s005", "text": "Bostadsbidraget beviljas gemensamt för hushållet på basis av en ansökan.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0125-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.548027210884354, "peak": 0.42095947265625, "generation_seconds": 22.267838247818872, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0126-s001", "text": "Beakta att om du delar bostad med till exempel en vän och ni har ett gemensamt hyresavtal så anses ni höra till samma hushåll.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0126-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.448979591836734, "peak": 0.26953125, "generation_seconds": 37.789761051069945, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0126-s002", "text": "Om du däremot bor på samma adress som en annan person och båda har ett eget hyresavtal, måste du i ansökan klargöra om ni är i ett samboförhållande.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0126-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 12.887074829931972, "peak": 0.30126953125, "generation_seconds": 40.00776808988303, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0126-s003", "text": "Gör så även om du har ett underhyresavtal.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0126-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.040272108843538, "peak": 0.28070068359375, "generation_seconds": 13.377829730976373, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0127-s001", "text": "Följande kan få allmänt bostadsbidrag:", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0127-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.040272108843538, "peak": 0.548858642578125, "generation_seconds": 13.063260057009757, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0128-s001", "text": "barnfamiljer", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0128-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 2.020136054421769, "peak": 0.298980712890625, "generation_seconds": 7.3452621679753065, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0130-s001", "text": "gifta par och registrerade par", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0130-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.1346938775510202, "peak": 0.279449462890625, "generation_seconds": 10.498845520196483, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0131-s001", "text": "sambor", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0131-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 1.6021768707482993, "peak": 0.36767578125, "generation_seconds": 5.486843557097018, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0132-s001", "text": "ensamboende eller", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0132-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 2.2987755102040817, "peak": 0.272918701171875, "generation_seconds": 10.497809835942462, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0133-s001", "text": "de som bor i kollektiv", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0133-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 2.5774149659863945, "peak": 0.30120849609375, "generation_seconds": 9.282850213116035, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0134-s001", "text": "studerande som bor med sitt eget barn eller med sin makas/makes barn eller som inte har rätt till studiestöd.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0134-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.195102040816327, "peak": 0.261688232421875, "generation_seconds": 27.7775536889676, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0135-s001", "text": "Hushållets tillgångar påverkar hur mycket bostadsbidrag ni kan få.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0135-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.7817687074829935, "peak": 0.269622802734375, "generation_seconds": 17.531796572962776, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0135-s002", "text": "Tillgångar är till exempel medel i banken.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0135-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.8312925170068026, "peak": 0.447723388671875, "generation_seconds": 11.342558816075325, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0136-s001", "text": "Bostadsbidrag kan beviljas för en fast bostad som ligger i Finland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0136-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.130068027210885, "peak": 0.315093994140625, "generation_seconds": 16.74675030983053, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0136-s002", "text": "I lagen fastställs vilka boendekostnader som kan godtas när stödet beräknas.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0136-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.757006802721088, "peak": 0.306640625, "generation_seconds": 22.75411833403632, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0136-s003", "text": "Bostaden kan vara", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0136-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 2.36843537414966, "peak": 0.35626220703125, "generation_seconds": 9.054893187014386, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0137-s001", "text": "en hyresbostad", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0137-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 2.159455782312925, "peak": 0.31396484375, "generation_seconds": 7.267121894983575, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0139-s001", "text": "en bostadsrättsbostad", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0139-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 2.716734693877551, "peak": 0.36114501953125, "generation_seconds": 9.19278174219653, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0140-s001", "text": "en delägarbostad.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0140-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 2.2987755102040817, "peak": 0.27935791015625, "generation_seconds": 8.937459148000926, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0141-s001", "text": "Du kan få stöd för till exempel hyran, vattenavgifterna och uppvärmningskostnaderna.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0141-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.523265306122449, "peak": 0.554046630859375, "generation_seconds": 18.86082988488488, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0142-s001", "text": "Bostadsbidrag beviljas för skäliga boendekostnader.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0142-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.876190476190477, "peak": 0.291717529296875, "generation_seconds": 13.65440790494904, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0142-s002", "text": "I stora städer accepteras högre boendekostnader än på små orter.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0142-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.921088435374149, "peak": 0.27313232421875, "generation_seconds": 16.26094246492721, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0143-s001", "text": "En del av boendekostnaderna måste du betala själv.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0143-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.9458503401360545, "peak": 0.230987548828125, "generation_seconds": 15.318610775051638, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0143-s002", "text": "För detta fastställs en bassjälvrisk.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0143-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.9706122448979593, "peak": 0.40887451171875, "generation_seconds": 17.81578576983884, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0143-s003", "text": "Bassjälvriskandelens storlek beror på:", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0143-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.9706122448979593, "peak": 0.333465576171875, "generation_seconds": 13.548471965827048, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0144-s001", "text": "hur många vuxna och barn som hör till hushållet", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0144-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.458231292517007, "peak": 0.289031982421875, "generation_seconds": 14.384363187011331, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0146-s001", "text": "hushållets bruttoinkomster (inkomster före skatt)", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0146-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.73687074829932, "peak": 0.337921142578125, "generation_seconds": 16.10548920999281, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0147-s001", "text": "Om inkomsterna är mycket låga bortfaller bassjälvrisken.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0147-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.50312925170068, "peak": 0.392425537109375, "generation_seconds": 16.595482436940074, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0148-s001", "text": "Det finns övre gränser för boendeutgifterna, det vill säga det största belopp som beaktas som boendeutgifter enligt vilket du kan få stöd för boendet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0148-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 12.19047619047619, "peak": 0.35845947265625, "generation_seconds": 28.04062162595801, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0148-s002", "text": "Detta kallas boendeutgifternas maximibelopp (enimmäisasumismenot).", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0148-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.060408163265306, "peak": 0.35406494140625, "generation_seconds": 17.469628720078617, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0148-s003", "text": "De påverkas av:", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0148-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 2.2987755102040817, "peak": 0.271392822265625, "generation_seconds": 8.105752233183011, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0149-s001", "text": "kommunen där bostaden är belägen", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0149-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.2043537414965986, "peak": 0.24969482421875, "generation_seconds": 9.854835946112871, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0151-s001", "text": "antalet vuxna och barn i hushållets storlek", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0151-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.249251700680272, "peak": 0.360137939453125, "generation_seconds": 9.855813021073118, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0152-s001", "text": "Om bostaden är större eller dyrare än vad lagen om allmänt bostadsbidrag tillåter växer den andel av boendekostnaderna som du betalar själv.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0152-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 12.678095238095239, "peak": 0.3125, "generation_seconds": 28.56996097485535, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0153-s001", "text": "Det allmänna bostadsbidraget är 70 procent av de godtagbara boendeutgifterna, med avdrag för bassjälvriskandelen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0153-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.588299319727891, "peak": 0.29180908203125, "generation_seconds": 24.34240674600005, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0153-s002", "text": "Om dina boendeutgifter är mindre än de godtagbara boendeutgifterna, beräknas stödbeloppet på grundval av de faktiska utgifterna.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0153-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.145578231292516, "peak": 0.373016357421875, "generation_seconds": 30.6194316172041, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0154-s001", "text": "Om dina inkomster, boende- eller familjeförhållanden eller andra omständigheter ändras ska du omgående anmäla ändringen till F P A.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0154-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.77251700680272, "peak": 0.27813720703125, "generation_seconds": 33.98574031610042, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0154-s002", "text": "I F P A:s beslut anges i detalj vilka omständigheter som bör anmälas.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0154-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.757006802721088, "peak": 0.312774658203125, "generation_seconds": 26.69015294709243, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0155-s001", "text": "Om du är studerande, kan du vanligtvis inte få allmänt bostadsbidrag.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0155-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.408707482993197, "peak": 0.283538818359375, "generation_seconds": 21.244674767833203, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0155-s002", "text": "Du kan däremot få studiestödets bostadstillägg, om du har rätt till studiestöd.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0155-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.1053061224489795, "peak": 0.302276611328125, "generation_seconds": 22.06705237017013, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0156-s001", "text": "Som studerande kan du få allmänt bostadsbidrag till exempel i följande situationer:", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0156-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.87156462585034, "peak": 0.455322265625, "generation_seconds": 27.300998124992475, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0157-s001", "text": "Du bor med ditt barn eller med din makas/makes barn.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0157-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.458231292517007, "peak": 0.2730712890625, "generation_seconds": 14.404688820010051, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0159-s001", "text": "Du får någon förmån på grund av vilken du inte kan få studiestöd.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0159-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.7817687074829935, "peak": 0.261932373046875, "generation_seconds": 20.589828894939274, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0160-s001", "text": "Du har avbrutit studierna eller har inte kvar några studiestödsmånader.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0160-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.2693877551020405, "peak": 0.312469482421875, "generation_seconds": 20.27800792013295, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0161-s001", "text": "Dina studier har inte framskridit tillräckligt och F P A har dragit in ditt studiestöd.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bostadsbidrag/narration/hb-c11-u0161-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.010884353741497, "peak": 0.32574462890625, "generation_seconds": 27.708051515044644, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
